   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Flower Border Colours</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Flower Border Colours\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication with the original photographs: 24 photographs of flower borders (perennial plantings) taken by one of the authors in urban green spaces, with lawn and sky removed so that each border stands on a black background, chosen by colour richness (low, slightly low, slightly high, high) and colour harmony (monochrome warm, monochrome cool and neutral, bicolour red-orange and yellow-green, bicolour orange-yellow and blue-violet, mixed colour cool and neutral, mixed colour warm). Participants first give gender, occupation and education, as in the paper, read the paper's meaning of emotional pleasure (how much you enjoy viewing the flower border in the picture right now) and rate each of the 24 pictures on the paper's 5-point scale from 1 = very unhappy to 5 = very happy. Rebuilt from Wan, Shen, Cai, Su, Ren & Xia (2024), How to Make Flower Borders Benefit Public Emotional Health in Urban Green Space: A Perspective of Color Characteristics, Forests 15(10): 1688, with the photographs cropped from its Figure 1 and the rating question from its Section 2.3 (CC BY 4.0). Image ids: b01-b24 = images 1#-24# of Figure 1; answers are in pleasure, keyed by image id; the colour harmony and richness class of each image is stored in the page's original-study block. Analysis as in the paper: mean pleasure per image, correlated with the images' HSV colour characteristics (hue shares, saturation and value levels, number of colours and plant patches), factor analysis of the correlated characteristics and a weighted evaluation model; the paper (281 valid online questionnaires, mostly aged 18-55, plus a separate facial-expression experiment with 60 people) found 13 colour characteristics related to pleasure, with blue, neutral purple and low saturation positive, summarised as low-saturation blue-violet share, colour diversity, bright red share and base green share. Differences from the original study: (1) only the online pleasure questionnaire is replicated; the paper's lab experiment that recorded facial expressions with face recognition software is not; (2) the gender, occupation and education questions, the instruction text and the wording of the rating question are ours (the paper prints only the definition of emotional pleasure and the scale ends), and the paper does not state the order of the pictures, so here they are shown one at a time in individually randomized order; (3) the image number labels printed in the figure were covered in black, matching the background; (4) the photographs are the figure copies (about 700 px wide), not the 3936 x 2214 px originals.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"borders\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"occupation\",\n      \"title\": \"Occupation\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"education\",\n      \"title\": \"Highest education\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"secondary\",\n        \"text\": \"Secondary school or below\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"college\",\n        \"text\": \"College or bachelor's degree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"graduate\",\n        \"text\": \"Master's degree or higher\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"borders\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"pleasure\",\n      \"title\": \"How happy does viewing this flower border make you feel right now?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 5,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Very unhappy\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Very happy\",\n      \"description\": \"Emotional pleasure: how much you enjoy viewing the flower border in the picture right now. 1 = very unhappy, 5 = very happy. Keyed by image id.\"\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"flower-original\">{\"source\": \"Wan, Shen, Cai, Su, Ren & Xia (2024) Forests 15: 1688\", \"n\": 281, \"images\": [\"b01\", \"b02\", \"b03\", \"b04\", \"b05\", \"b06\", \"b07\", \"b08\", \"b09\", \"b10\", \"b11\", \"b12\", \"b13\", \"b14\", \"b15\", \"b16\", \"b17\", \"b18\", \"b19\", \"b20\", \"b21\", \"b22\", \"b23\", \"b24\"], \"classes\": {\"b01\": {\"harmony\": \"Monochrome (warm)\", \"richness\": \"low\"}, \"b02\": {\"harmony\": \"Monochrome (warm)\", \"richness\": \"slightly low\"}, \"b03\": {\"harmony\": \"Monochrome (warm)\", \"richness\": \"slightly high\"}, \"b04\": {\"harmony\": \"Monochrome (warm)\", \"richness\": \"high\"}, \"b05\": {\"harmony\": \"Monochrome (cool and neutral)\", \"richness\": \"low\"}, \"b06\": {\"harmony\": \"Monochrome (cool and neutral)\", \"richness\": \"slightly low\"}, \"b07\": {\"harmony\": \"Monochrome (cool and neutral)\", \"richness\": \"slightly high\"}, \"b08\": {\"harmony\": \"Monochrome (cool and neutral)\", \"richness\": \"high\"}, \"b09\": {\"harmony\": \"Bicolor (red-orange and yellow-green)\", \"richness\": \"low\"}, \"b10\": {\"harmony\": \"Bicolor (red-orange and yellow-green)\", \"richness\": \"slightly low\"}, \"b11\": {\"harmony\": \"Bicolor (red-orange and yellow-green)\", \"richness\": \"slightly high\"}, \"b12\": {\"harmony\": \"Bicolor (red-orange and yellow-green)\", \"richness\": \"high\"}, \"b13\": {\"harmony\": \"Bicolor (orange-yellow and blue-violet)\", \"richness\": \"low\"}, \"b14\": {\"harmony\": \"Bicolor (orange-yellow and blue-violet)\", \"richness\": \"slightly low\"}, \"b15\": {\"harmony\": \"Bicolor (orange-yellow and blue-violet)\", \"richness\": \"slightly high\"}, \"b16\": {\"harmony\": \"Bicolor (orange-yellow and blue-violet)\", \"richness\": \"high\"}, \"b17\": {\"harmony\": \"Mixed color (cool and neutral)\", \"richness\": \"low\"}, \"b18\": {\"harmony\": \"Mixed color (cool and neutral)\", \"richness\": \"slightly low\"}, \"b19\": {\"harmony\": \"Mixed color (cool and neutral)\", \"richness\": \"slightly high\"}, \"b20\": {\"harmony\": \"Mixed color (cool and neutral)\", \"richness\": \"high\"}, \"b21\": {\"harmony\": \"Mixed color (warm)\", \"richness\": \"low\"}, \"b22\": {\"harmony\": \"Mixed color (warm)\", \"richness\": \"slightly low\"}, \"b23\": {\"harmony\": \"Mixed color (warm)\", \"richness\": \"slightly high\"}, \"b24\": {\"harmony\": \"Mixed color (warm)\", \"richness\": \"high\"}}}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f3f1ee;--card:#fff;--ink:#21201c;--muted:#5f5b53;--accent:#7b3f6e;--line:#ddd8d0;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#f1e1ec}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.08rem;margin:0 0 4px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\n.prompt{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0;text-align:center}\n.scene{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;background:var(--bg);padding-bottom:6px}\n.scene img{max-width:100%;max-height:52vh;width:auto;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px}\n@media (max-height:700px),(max-width:600px){.scene{position:static}}\n.it{padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.it .st{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:.96rem}\n.it .o{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px}\n.it label{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:4px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 4px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.25}\n.it label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.it label input{display:none}.it .an{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}@media (max-width:480px){.it .o{gap:3px}.it label{padding:9px 0;font-size:.86rem}}\n.it .an{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}\n.it.miss .o,.q.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:8px}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q:first-child{margin-top:0}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\ninput[type=text]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin-top:6px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photographs and rating question: Wan, Shen, Cai, Su, Ren &amp; Xia (2024), Forests 15(10): 1688, Figure 1 and Section 2.3 (doi:10.3390/f15101688, CC BY 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='flower-border-pleasure:state';\n  var ORIG=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('flower-original').textContent), IDS=ORIG.images;\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function fresh(){return {step:'intro',order:shuffle(IDS),k:0};}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Flower borders</h1><p>You will see 24 pictures of flower borders, one at a time. For each picture, rate how happy viewing the flower border makes you feel right now, from 1 (very unhappy) to 5 (very happy). It takes about 5 minutes.</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='about';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function about(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"q\" data-q=\"gender\"><b>'+esc(Q.gender.title)+'</b>'+(Q.gender.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"gender\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>'+\n      '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"occupation\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><b>'+esc(Q.occupation.title)+'</b><br><input type=\"text\" id=\"occ\" maxlength=\"120\" style=\"font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin-top:6px\"></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"education\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><b>'+esc(Q.education.title)+'</b>'+(Q.education.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"education\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>'+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Continue</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var g=app.querySelector('input[name=gender]:checked'),e=app.querySelector('input[name=education]:checked'),o=document.getElementById('occ').value.trim();\n      if(!g)return err('Please choose your gender.');if(!o)return err('Please enter your occupation.');if(!e)return err('Please choose your education.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('gender',g.value),SPSite.answer('occupation',o),SPSite.answer('education',e.value)],this,function(){st.step='room';st.k=0;save();route();});};\n  }\n  function room(){\n    if(st.k>=st.order.length){st.step='done';save();return route();}\n    var id=st.order[st.k],f=files[id],q=Q.pleasure;\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Picture '+(st.k+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</div><div class=\"scene\"><img alt=\"Photograph of a flower border\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><h2>'+esc(q.title)+'</h2><p style=\"margin:2px 0 6px\">Emotional pleasure: how much you enjoy viewing the flower border in the picture right now.</p><div class=\"it\" data-n=\"p\"><div class=\"o\">'+[1,2,3,4,5].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"p\" value=\"'+v+'\">'+v+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"an\"><span>1 '+esc(q.minRateDescription||'Very unhappy')+'</span><span>5 '+esc(q.maxRateDescription||'Very happy')+'</span></div></div></div>'+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+(st.k<st.order.length-1?'Next picture':'Finish')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var x=app.querySelector('input[name=p]:checked');if(!x){app.querySelector('.it').classList.add('miss');return err('Please choose a rating.');}\n      send([SPSite.answer('pleasure',Number(x.value),{key:id,shown:[f.name]})],this,function(){st.k++;save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  app.addEventListener('change',function(e){var r=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('.it');if(r){r.classList.remove('miss');if(!app.querySelector('.it.miss'))err('');}});\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='about')return about();if(s==='room')return room();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','gender','occupation','education','pleasure'].forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{name:n};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('borders')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=IDS.filter(function(k){return !files[k];});\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+esc(need.join(', '))+' (.jpg) to the media folder \"borders\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.order)||a.consent!==true)st=fresh();\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
